{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo將於明（23日）在內地正式發售，多地出現排隊人龍。</p><p>惟內地多名科技博主昨發布測評顯示，微信、QQ 等常用App尚未適配摺疊屏尺寸，出現大面積黑邊或變形等問題，引發熱議。</p><p>蘋果客服回應，建議以官方信息為準；</p><p>微信則表示正積極推進適配，將盡快更新。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T11:21:45.268194+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:56:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T00:17:57.907416+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:40.427111+00:00","content_hash":"e6e856e5f179e2f6f41caa6de09b0b45b581a19c70aa0b87fad6cc7af54b4b34","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}